          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " spell is cast with 1 action, its range is 30 feet; if it's cast with 2 actions, its range is 60 feet. This has no effect on the three-action area version of "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "harm",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", though in most cases, you don't have enough actions to Activate the token and cast a three-action "
          },
          {
